{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmzHt6tV7YjnPU6iQRRQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm not deciding anything today. I'll ask you, or someone I trust, before I touch the deposits. I'm not very sure what I saw, either. Harel is a name I know, and the page does show everything they have and what each one costs, so I got that much. But by the fourth screen I couldn't tell one line from the next.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **Top of the page:** \"הראל\", and then \"כל המוצרים של הראל\" with buttons: \"105 כל המוצרים\", \"קופת גמל להשקעה 16\", \"קרן השתלמות 16\", \"חיסכון לכל ילד 4\" and more. Under them, \"96 מסלולים ב־7 מוצרים\". That's 96 choices. It opens straight onto shares, \"מט\"ח\" and \"S&P 500\", on a black background, and nothing about deposits.\n2. **\"קופת גמל להשקעה\":**\n   - Every row says the same \"ההפקדה 0%\" and \"ההחיסכון\" next to the fee. Most fees are about \"0.54%\" to \"0.61%\".\n   - The column \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\" mostly says \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", so there's nothing to compare.\n   - The ones that do have numbers are mostly share tracks: \"24.04%\" on \"מניות\", \"13.7%\" on \"S&P 500\".\n   - The only one that sounded like money in the bank was \"כספי (שקלי)\": \"4.25%\" over 3 years, \"3.08%\" over 5, with a fee of \"0.57%\". I'm not sure that's really like a deposit. It also seems to me the fee eats a good part of it.\n3. **\"קרן השתלמות\", \"תגמולים\", \"חיסכון לכל ילד\", \"קרן חדשה מקיפה\":** the same rows over and over.\n   - \"חיסכון לכל ילד\" shows a fee of \"0.01%\". That caught my eye because of the grandchildren.\n   - The pension funds show \"0.16%\" and \"1.47%\" again and again.\n4. **Screen five:** I got as far as \"מרכזית לפיצויים\" and the start of \"קרנות מחקות\". I stopped there, because \"מחקות\" means nothing to me. I didn't look at screens six and seven at all.\n\n**What tired me**\n- On every row I read \"ההחיסכון\", \"ההפקדה\", \"מניות\" and \"מט\"ח\" again, with the same two-coloured circle, just to find the one number that's different. They could have said it once.\n- The little circles in turquoise and yellow: I couldn't tell what they mean, and the percentages are written next to them, not on them.\n- After four screens of the same rows, I was finished.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n\"מט\"ח\" next to a percentage, \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"מסלול\", \"תשואה... לפני דמי ניהול\", \"PF-06\" and \"PF-10\", \"123 מקורו / 123 מחושב\". I couldn't tell whether \"4.25% 3 שנים\" means a year or for all three years.\n\n**What I couldn't read**\nThe small grey lines at the top, under the name, and at the bottom of the table were too pale and small for me, even enlarged.\n\n**What I didn't find**\n- Anything that compares these to a bank deposit, or says which track is safe.\n- A sentence in plain words saying what is good for someone like me."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3535,"cache_read_input_tokens":18294,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3535},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dc0ef841-3d1e-44ab-aa0a-4dbeeb9dd4a8","uuid":"12754877-030c-4fa2-9d02-fae161673b7e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:27:34.657Z","request_id":"req_011CgmzHsipBo1ByEZyvZ272"}
